<span id="alg3.l7.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg3.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Step 3: <span id="alg3.l7.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Data-consistency refinement</span> (multi-step proximal via <math id="alg3.l7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>l</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l</annotation></semantics></math> CG steps)
</span>
</div>
