                <math id="alg3.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{{\bm{x}}}_{t}\leftarrow\bar{{\bm{x}}}_{t}*h_{\sigma_{t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">∗</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{{\bm{x}}}_{t}\leftarrow\bar{{\bm{x}}}_{t}*h_{\sigma_{t}}</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg3.l8.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg3.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Step 4: <span id="alg3.l8.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Scheduled low-pass filtering</span> (mitigate VAE error accumulation)
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
                
                
                <math id="alg3.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{{\bm{z}}}_{t}\leftarrow\mathcal{E}_{\theta}(\bar{{\bm{x}}}_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{{\bm{z}}}_{t}\leftarrow\mathcal{E}_{\theta}(\bar{{\bm{x}}}_{t})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
                
                
                <math id="alg3.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{z}}_{t-1}\leftarrow\sqrt{\bar{\alpha}_{t-1}}\bar{{\bm{z}}}_{t}+\sqrt{1-\bar{\alpha}_{t-1}}\mathcal{E}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><msqrt><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{z}}_{t-1}\leftarrow\sqrt{\bar{\alpha}_{t-1}}\bar{{\bm{z}}}_{t}+\sqrt{1-\bar{\alpha}_{t-1}}\mathcal{E}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg3.l10.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg3.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Step 5: <span id="alg3.l10.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Renoising</span> (batch-consistent noise)
</span>
</div>
