</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.5 </span>Ablation study</h3>

<div id="A1.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To better understand the impact of the data-consistency updates in L
<span id="A1.SS5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:7.5pt;height:6.8pt;vertical-align:-6.8pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="width:7.5pt;transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) rotate(-180deg) ;">
<span id="A1.SS5.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">A</span>
</span></span>TINO, we perform an ablation study comparing different strategies for the likelihood <span id="A1.SS5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">proximal steps</span> appearing in Equation (<span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span>). Furthermore, we provide results on <span id="A1.SS5.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Problem A</span> and <span id="A1.SS5.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Problem B</span> obtained with a lighter version of L
<span id="A1.SS5.p1.1.5" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:7.5pt;height:6.8pt;vertical-align:-6.8pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="width:7.5pt;transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) rotate(-180deg) ;">
<span id="A1.SS5.p1.1.5.1" class="ltx_p">A</span>
</span></span>TINO that only includes the VCM prior. We call this version L
<span id="A1.SS5.p1.1.6" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:7.5pt;height:6.8pt;vertical-align:-6.8pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="width:7.5pt;transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) rotate(-180deg) ;">
<span id="A1.SS5.p1.1.6.1" class="ltx_p">A</span>
</span></span>TINO-V and we provide in Algorithm <a href="#alg4" title="Algorithm 4 ‣ L A TINO-V as a lighter alternative. ‣ A.5 Ablation study ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ L A TINO: LAtent Video consisTency INverse sOlver for High Definition Video Restoration" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> its implementation.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T2" class="ltx_table ltx_align_floatright" style="width:41%;">
<table id="A1.T2.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
