<div id="A2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Additional examples are shown in Figures <a href="#A2.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ Appendix B Additional examples ‣ L A TINO: LAtent Video consisTency INverse sOlver for High Definition Video Restoration" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>,<a href="#A2.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ Appendix B Additional examples ‣ L A TINO: LAtent Video consisTency INverse sOlver for High Definition Video Restoration" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>,<a href="#A2.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ Appendix B Additional examples ‣ L A TINO: LAtent Video consisTency INverse sOlver for High Definition Video Restoration" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>,<a href="#A2.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ Appendix B Additional examples ‣ L A TINO: LAtent Video consisTency INverse sOlver for High Definition Video Restoration" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>,<a href="#A2.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ Appendix B Additional examples ‣ L A TINO: LAtent Video consisTency INverse sOlver for High Definition Video Restoration" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>. We also include additional sliced images in Figures <a href="#A2.F7.sf1" title="In Figure 7 ‣ Appendix B Additional examples ‣ L A TINO: LAtent Video consisTency INverse sOlver for High Definition Video Restoration" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7(a)</span></a> and <a href="#A2.F7.sf2" title="In Figure 7 ‣ Appendix B Additional examples ‣ L A TINO: LAtent Video consisTency INverse sOlver for High Definition Video Restoration" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7(b)</span></a>.</p>
</div>
